  "technical_and_design_decisions": [
    "All modules will be implemented using Spring Boot to align with Spring Cloud Stream's architecture.",
    "Existing XD modules will be adapted to s-c-s by reusing core logic where possible, with refactoring for Spring Cloud Stream compatibility.",
    "The Flink processor will integrate with Apache Flink's Java API for streaming machine learning abstractions.",
    "The job DSL will leverage Spring's existing DSL capabilities and integrate with Spring Cloud Data Flow for workflow orchestration.",
    "Kinesis sink will use the AWS SDK for Java to interact with Amazon Kinesis streams."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "XD modules are written in Java and can be ported with minimal language-level changes.",
    "The development team has prior experience with Spring Cloud Stream and XD codebases.",
    "Testing frameworks (e.g., JUnit, Mockito) are already in place for s-c-s modules.",
